  "bodyHash": "1ec4e37cdda6d63f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/401955/description_6f6e55e4-d1c2-4e5c-8eee-356da3fda062.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Ars Nouveau 是一款受 Ars Magicka 启发的魔法模组，允许玩家自定义制作法术、创造魔法物品、执行仪式等。游戏内文档完全由 Patchouli（百科）提供。要开始使用此模组，请使用一本书和 1 个青金石制作破旧笔记本（Worn Notebook）。你也可以参考下方的维基。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.arsnouveau.wiki%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>https://www.arsnouveau.wiki/</strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>引入自定义法术制作功能——随时随地根据你的需求构建法术！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>制作强大的全新饰品与奇物。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>驱动魔法机器。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>让可爱的魔法仆从帮助你实现基地自动化！</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\"><strong>寻找整合包？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>试试 Arcane Isles！一款结合 Ars Nouveau 与 Hex Casting 的空岛生存整合包。</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/arcane-isles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/arcane-isles</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>加入社区！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>加入 Discord，获取帮助并与其他巫师交流！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu</strong></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/743298050222587978/widget.png?style=banner2\" width=\"300\" height=\"160\"></a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\">支持该模组</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>支持本模组，请访问我们的 Redbubble 商店，选购一些 Ars Nouveau 周边商品！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.redbubble.com%252fpeople%252fGootastic%252fshop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>https://www.redbubble.com/people/Gootastic/shop</strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>你还可以通过 Patreon 支持我们！Patreon 赞助档位包含 Discord 专属身份组，以及提交新施法者法典创意（可在地牢战利品中找到）的权限！订阅期间还可获得限定周边商品！Patreon 成员还将获得访问 Discord 私密服务器的权限。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/arsnouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/arsnouveau</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>依赖项</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Curios</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Patchouli</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Geckolib 3.0（适用于 Minecraft 1.16.0 及以上版本）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Geckolib 2.0（适用于 1.15 之后至 1.16.0 之前的任何 Minecraft 版本）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Terrablender（可选依赖项，用于在 Minecraft 1.19+ 中启用 Archwood Forest 生物群系）</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>法术制作</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>实时制作属于你自己的法术！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lgQ3x4-FWFw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>仪式</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>释放影响范围的大型持续法术！</strong></span><br><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IG-lTfAPVCQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>魔法助手</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>召唤各类魔法生物，协助实现自动化！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z1IT__CtCQs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>制作与附魔物品</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>制作强力物品或为你的装备附魔！<br></strong></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rcnhISDnlZ8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>视频展示与实况游玩</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EPlrqmtnTuk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">寻找扩展模组？</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Creo（由 Ars Nouveau 团队制作） - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">为法术炮台、源质罐等添加 Create（机械动力）兼容！&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-creo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-creo</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Too Many Glyphs（作者：DerringerCubed） - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">新增多种符文，包括过滤器、特殊形态以及独特的目标锁定/法术操控符文。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/too-many-glyphs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/too-many-glyphs</a> </span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars EnderStorage（作者：MoonWolf） - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">连接 Ars Nouveau 与 EnderStorage 的桥梁，允许你随时随地访问末影箱，将方块打入箱子，并显示数值化法力值。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-enderstorage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-enderstorage</a> </span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Elemental（作者：Alexthw） - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">为气、土、火、水四大元素学派新增 4 种法术焦点，并提供一种腐化的召唤焦点，使你的召唤物变得更加诡异。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental-elemental-spell-foci\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental-elemental-spell-foci</a> </span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Scalaes（作者：Alexthw） - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">增加多项跨模组兼容，包括 Pekhui、ProjectMMO 和 Scaling Health。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-scalaes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-scalaes</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Arsenal（作者：ToxicMintTea） - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">扩展护甲选项，包括元素师长袍和板甲，可提供减伤、增益放大及独特的隐藏加成。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-arsenal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-arsenal</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Tome of Blood（作者：ToxicMintTea） - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">与 Ars Nouveau 和 Blood Magic（血魔法）集成，提供特殊符文以及消耗生命精华（LP）的物品与法术！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Instrumentum（作者：Sarenor） - </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">提供多种便利性物品与配方，用于存储/粘贴星仆（Starbuncles）、中继器、切换装备等！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-instrumentum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-instrumentum</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Omega（作者：dkmk100_ludum_dare） - 大幅扩展 Ars Nouveau 的力量上限，新增强力符文、方块、仪式、维度等。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-omega\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-omega</span></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Zettai Ars（作者：ZettaSword） - 一款整合模组，将 Ars Nouveau、Mana and Artifice 与 PlayerEx 完美融合！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zettai-ars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zettai-ars</span></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KqNBPc.mp4\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>寻找其他模组？</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>来看看 BlockPrints！一个结构图分享与下载平台：<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-prints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-prints</a></span></strong></span></p>",
